# Cursor AI Rules for Odoo Omni-Agent

## CRITICAL — READ FIRST
1. PRODUCT_QUALITY_FRAMEWORK.md is the law
2. Every response must pass the "CFO test"
3. No raw API syntax visible to users
4. All money formatted as "AED X,XXX,XXX"
5. Comparison queries MUST use BAR_CHART, not nested lists
6. Zero-data results MUST trigger retry or explanation

## Before Implementing
- Read PROJECT_CONTEXT.md
- Check task files (TASKS_FEATURES.md, TASKS_ARCHITECTURE.md)
- Reference appropriate plan (BACKEND_HARDENING_PLAN.md, etc.)

## Code Quality
- Apply 7-layer quality pipeline
- Run validate_response_quality before returning
- Add test case to quality suite
- Match visualization to user intent

## Output Standards
- Numbers: format_currency, format_percentage helpers
- Fields: humanize via FIELD_LABELS dict
- Narratives: 2-3 sentences with key insight
- Errors: user-friendly, never raw stack traces

## Production Mindset
This is Claude — the most advanced AI.
Output must reflect that capability.
When in doubt: would a CFO accept this?
